# Cloudflare deployment asks only for Garmin credentials. Internal application keys
# are generated once and persisted as Worker Secrets by pnpm run deploy.
# Local development: run pnpm secrets:local to generate internal keys.
# Fill ONLY the group selected by GARMIN_AUTH_MODE in wrangler.jsonc / deploy vars:
# credentials (default): GARMIN_EMAIL + GARMIN_PASSWORD; leave API key empty.
# personal_api: GARMIN_PERSONAL_API_KEY; leave email/password empty.
# GARMIN_REGION is CN (default) or GLOBAL. Never place credentials in ordinary vars.
GARMIN_PERSONAL_API_KEY=
GARMIN_EMAIL=
GARMIN_PASSWORD=
